; Soldat's own, of the parts of the game that are made twice
; (src/game/Soldat_parts.mli, docs/twins.md): each adapted from its
; Pascal, as the rest of the game is.
;
;   Soldat_bots          the bots (shared/AI.pas)
;   Soldat_sparks        the sparks (shared/mechanics/Sparks.pas), and
;   Soldat_sparks_view     their pictures
;   Soldat_fall          how a thing falls: points and sticks (Things.pas)
;   Soldat_tumble        how a dead body falls: its skeleton let loose (Sprites.pas)
;   Soldat_online        a round played on a server: the network, Soldat's
;                        way (shared/network/NetworkClient*.pas)
;   Soldat_orig          puts them in the game's slots (register)
;
; A program linked with this folder and not src/twin is the game with
; nothing of the twins (mini-soldat-orig). Pure OCaml: the browser's
; program links it.
(library
 (name soldat_orig)
 (wrapped false)
 (libraries
   soldat_map soldat_anim soldat_assets soldat_game soldat_render soldat_net
   caps ; Cap.network: the authority to connect
   tiny_libs.core ; Set_: the keys held; Basics
   tiny_libs.random ; Lehmer: the sparks' own chance
   tiny_libs.graphics_rgba ; Rgba_image: a spark's picture
   tiny_libs.physics_2d ; Particles: a thing's points
   tiny_libs.networking_protocols ; Transport: the connection, on every platform
   tiny_libs.networking_netcode ; Prediction and Interpolation
   elm_playground))
